  "_comment_SCOPE": "This ItemList intentionally lists only the 2 service pages that are in sitemap.xml (the audit's defined scope). The live /services/ hub page's HTML also links to 3 further location pages NOT in the sitemap: /services/us-visa-appointment-australia/, /services/us-visa-appointment-dubai/, /services/us-visa-appointment-uae/. This is an indexing/sitemap gap (same pattern as the already-known /for-agents/ gap), not strictly a schema defect -- flagged here for visibility. If those 3 pages are meant to be indexed, add them to sitemap.xml and give each the same Service+Offer+BreadcrumbList pattern as file 04.",
